# go_router drives real paths (/upload, /lines, /review), so a hard refresh or a
# pasted deep link asks Cloudflare for a file that was never built. Hand those
# requests the app shell instead and let the router read the URL.
#
# Pages matches real static files first, so this never shadows main.dart.js,
# assets or canvaskit. The 200 (rather than a 302) keeps the address bar on the
# route the user actually asked for.
/*    /index.html    200
